cff-version: "1.2.0"
type: software
message: "If you use this software, please cite this repository and record the commit you used."
title: "Offline video publication-date linter"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-10-17"
authors:
  - family-names: "Samadi"
    given-names: "Ahmadreza"
    website: "https://a-samadi.com/about.html"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ahmadreza-smdi/video-date-lint"
url: "https://github.com/ahmadreza-smdi/video-date-lint/releases/tag/v0.1.0"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  AI-assisted original Python utility for checking publication dates in local
  video JSON-LD and optional video sitemaps without changing the input files
  or making network requests. It reports syntax and internal-consistency
  diagnostics; it does not establish the real first-publication time,
  indexing, rankings or business results.
keywords:
  - "video metadata"
  - "publication dates"
  - "JSON-LD"
  - "sitemaps"
  - "offline validation"
